# Bug Hunt Agent Mode

When running bug hunt (see `.cursor/BUG-HUNT-AGENT.md`):

1. Loop until `data/bug-registry.json` → `cumulativeFixed >= 10000` OR 01:00 IDT
2. Every bug fix requires a unique `testId` test added
3. Run `npm run test:ci` before commit; commit + push autonomously
4. Read `data/bug-hunt-last-explore.json` on explore failures
5. Do not stop early; proactively fuzz unexplored code paths
